Yes, it seems that objects are not being destroyed [1]. We had a
workaround for this kind of issue for a number of years, but it seems
that it doesn't work anymore for some reason. And also the finalizer
is not executed [2], but that's not the issue in your case.

Iñaki

[1] https://github.com/r-simmer/simmer/issues/278
[2] https://github.com/r-simmer/simmer/issues/277

